{"product":{"id":7413068136491,"title":"Mother of Pearl Serving Spoon 6-Pack Set, 4 inch, Velvet Pouch","body_html":"\u003cp data-start=\"107\" data-end=\"167\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"107\" data-end=\"167\"\u003e4 Inch Mother of Pearl Spoon SET OF SIX In Velvet Pack\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"169\" data-end=\"584\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"\u003eThis elegant bundle includes six high-quality Mother of Pearl serving spoons, beautifully packaged in a velvety storage pouch. Handcrafted from 100% real nacre, collected from special ocean mollusks, these spoons are carefully hand-cut and polished to perfection. The long curved design fits comfortably in your hand, elevating your caviar serving experience with a luxurious and polished presentation.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"586\" data-end=\"801\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"\u003eUnlike metal and wooden spoons, which can negatively affect the taste of fine caviar, the shiny, rainbow-reflective mother of pearl material preserves the delicate flavor, making it the perfect utensil for serving.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"803\" data-end=\"820\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"803\" data-end=\"820\"\u003eKey Features:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul data-start=\"821\" data-end=\"1008\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"821\" data-end=\"878\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"\u003eMade from 100% real ocean nacre shell (Mother of Pearl)\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"879\" data-end=\"949\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"\u003eHigher quality and more reflective than plain white freshwater shell\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"950\" data-end=\"1008\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"\u003ePackaged in a velvety pouch for storage and presentation\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e","vendor":"Caviar Star","product_type":"physical","created_at":"2025-07-11T03:59:39-04:00","handle":"mother-of-pearl-serving-spoon-6-pack-set-4-5-inch-velvet-pouch","updated_at":"2026-10-06T06:19:11-04:00","published_at":"2025-07-11T03:59:40-04:00","template_suffix":null,"published_scope":"global","tags":"Bulk spoons, By_Country, Caviar spoon set, MOP, MOP Set, MOP Spoon, Mother of Pearl, Mother of Pearl Spoon, Serving ware, Spoon, Spoon Set, Tea spoons","variants":[{"id":41890808102955,"product_id":7413068136491,"title":"Default Title","price":"45.00","sku":"U-S MOP 4.5-6","position":1,"compare_at_price":"60.00","fulfillment_service":"manual","inventory_management":"shopify","option1":"Default Title","option2":null,"option3":null,"created_at":"2025-07-11T03:59:39-04:00","updated_at":"2026-10-06T06:19:11-04:00","taxable":false,"barcode":"713336009035","grams":408,"image_id":35100607610923,"weight":0.9,"weight_unit":"lb","unit_price":"7.50","unit_price_measurement":{"measured_type":"count","quantity_value":"6.0","quantity_unit":"item","reference_value":1,"reference_unit":"item"},"requires_shipping":true,"quantity_rule":{"min":1,"max":null,"increment":1},"price_currency":"USD","compare_at_price_currency":"USD","quantity_price_breaks":[]}],"options":[{"id":9479473135659,"product_id":7413068136491,"name":"Title","position":1,"values":["Default Title"]}],"images":[{"id":35100607578155,"product_id":7413068136491,"position":1,"created_at":"2025-07-11T03:59:42-04:00","updated_at":"2025-07-11T03:59:44-04:00","alt":"six mother of pearl serving spoons neatly packaged